OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FThe death toll of a powerful
OL,7,Fearthquake that struck Indonesia on
OL,8,FSaturday has risen to 68, with
OL,9,Fthousands of people waiting for aid
OL,10,Ftwo days later.
OL,12,FMore than 200 people were injured
OL,13,Ffollowing the 7.7 magnitude quake and
OL,14,Fthousands more were displaced as their
OL,15,Fhomes were damaged.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
