OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787080721
OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FOn Monday people on Flores island in
OL,7,FEast Nusa Tenggara province spent the
OL,8,Fday mourning victims while military
OL,9,Fteams tried to deliver food, clean
OL,10,Fwater and clothing to inaccessible
OL,11,Fcommunities by plane.
OL,13,FAs Indonesia marked its 81st
OL,14,FIndependence Day on Monday in the
OL,15,Fcapital, Jakarta, President Prabowo
OL,16,FSubianto asked participants to pray
OL,17,Ffor people affected, while leading a
OL,18,Fnationwide moment of silence honouring
OL,19,Fthe nation's independence heroes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
