PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787080721
OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,F"My house is just rubble now," said
OL,7,FRasyid Jafar, a clothing trader in the
OL,8,Fvillage of Reo, the hardest-hit area
OL,9,Fin Manggarai regency. "We need food,
OL,10,Fmedicine and clean water urgently."
OL,12,FMore than 4,500 homes were damaged
OL,13,Fwhen the quake struck Flores island
OL,14,Fearly on Saturday. The province's
OL,15,Fgovernor declared a 14-day state of
OL,16,Femergency the following day.
OL,18,FSome 19,000 people were forced into
OL,19,Ftemporary shelters and 213 people were
OL,20,Finjured, according to the National
OL,21,FDisaster Management Agency.
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@^O]rD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
