FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787080721
OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FThe disaster also damaged 122 health
OL,7,Ffacilities, 252 schools and 84 places
OL,8,Fof worship.
OL,10,FThe earthquake struck at a depth of 10
OL,11,Fkilometres shortly before 6am on
OL,12,FSaturday, and authorities have since
OL,13,Frecorded 1,576 aftershocks into
OL,14,FMonday, though only 54 were felt by
OL,15,Fresidents.
OL,17,FThousands of people on Flores camped
OL,18,Foutside collapsed homes under
OL,19,Ftarpaulin tents overnight into Monday,
OL,20,Fsleeping outside because of the danger
OL,21,Fof more aftershocks.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
