PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787080721
OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FFor many Indonesians, the disaster
OL,7,Frevived painful memories of a powerful
OL,8,Fearthquake and tsunami that struck
OL,9,FFlores in 1992, killing about 2,500
OL,10,Fpeople.
OL,12,FThe government said more than 1,800
OL,13,Fmilitary and police personnel have
OL,14,Fbeen deployed across the disaster
OL,15,Fzone, supported by 10 aircraft and
OL,16,Fseveral vessels, to distribute more
OL,17,Fthan 100 metric tons of emergency aid.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
