PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787080721
OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FAuthorities set up two emergency field
OL,7,Fhospitals in the worst-hit town of
OL,8,FRuteng to treat earthquake victims
OL,9,Fafter local hospitals were damaged,
OL,10,Fwith two crisis management teams
OL,11,Foverseeing a health emergency
OL,12,Foperation centre.
OL,14,FAid workers reached tiny Palue Island,
OL,15,Fone of the areas closest to the
OL,16,Fearthquake's epicentre, late on
OL,17,FSunday, after a difficult sea and land
OL,18,Fjourney through landslide-hit terrain,
OL,19,Fauthorities said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
