CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1787080721
OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,F"The roads are steep and many were
OL,7,Fblocked by landslides. It was a near-
OL,8,Fdeath journey," said the deputy police
OL,9,Fchief of Sikka regency, Marselus Yugo
OL,10,FAmboro, whose team was among the first
OL,11,Fto reach the island with supplies.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FHe said initial assessments revealed
OL,19,Fextensive damage, with one villager
OL,20,Fkilled, two seriously injured and
OL,21,Fnearly 150 homes destroyed.
