OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FIndonesia, an archipelago of more than
OL,7,F17,000 islands, is prone to
OL,8,Fearthquakes and volcanic eruptions
OL,9,Fbecause of its location on the Pacific
OL,10,F"Ring of Fire," a horseshoe-shaped arc
OL,11,Fof seismic faults and volcanoes.
OL,13,FIn 2018, a magnitude 7.5 earthquake
OL,14,Ftriggered a tsunami on the island of
OL,15,FSulawesi that killed more than 4,400
OL,16,Fpeople.
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@OO]
