OL,3,CThousands in Indonesia waiting for aid
OL,4,Cafter earthquake kills 68 people
OL,6,FIn 2004, a magnitude 9.1 quake off
OL,7,FSumatra unleashed a tsunami that
OL,8,Fkilled about 230,000 people in a dozen
OL,9,Fcountries, nearly 170,000 in Aceh
OL,10,Fprovince alone.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/9
